0.01: Official release
0.02: Fix misbehavior if multiple alarms become active at once
0.03: Fix issues with snoozing timers past midnight (#4241)
0.04: Various UI improvements:
      * Implement recent features from sched's alarm alert (snooze
        menu on long-press, support for Button Stops Alarm setting in
        Alarm app)
      * Allow long-press on alarm alert OK button to override “On
        alarm go to” setting
      * Use correct theme color of timer-running widget
      * Improve tap detection of format screen arrows
      * Improve support of count-up timers (no negative sign, proper
        reset confirmation, hide inapplicable options, better default
        name)
